
 build in the background, ask a subagent, and wait for them


start check $ just check (Checking the whole tree)
spawn subagent · anthropic/claude-opus-5@medium (Finding where the parser lives)
wait docs ✗ nothing is named docs
wait job:check || tame-adder 4L ~100t (Checking the whole tree; Finding where the parser lives)
stop check (Checking the whole tree)

The subagent found the parser; the check is stopped.


 🐍 Subagent tame-adder interjects:

    The parser is in parse.go.



 carry on


